# Walkthrough: 3D Redesign & Realistic Imagery

The redesign of the "YemekSipariş" landing page is now complete. The goal was to achieve a 3D aesthetic and use more realistic food imagery to create a premium user experience.

## Changes Made

### 1. 3D Hero Section
Created a two-column hero layout featuring a hyper-realistic burger. Added a floating animation (`animate-float`) to the image to give it a 3D, "live" feel.

![Hero Section Redesign](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/hero_section_redesign_1774688817059.png)

### 2. Realistic Restaurant Imagery
Replaced placeholder images with professionally generated realistic food photos for Pizza, Sushi, and Desserts.

![Realistic Restaurant Cards](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/restaurant_cards_realistic_1774688830656.png)

### 3. Glassmorphism & Depth
Upgraded the navigation bar and search bar with enhanced `backdrop-filter` effects and deeper `box-shadow` values to create a sense of depth and hierarchy.

## Validation Results

- **Visual Inspection**: Confirmed high-fidelity imagery and smooth transitions in the browser.
- **Animations**: Verified that the floating effect is active and non-distracting.
- **Responsiveness**: The grid system adjusts correctly for mobile and desktop views.

